This project delivers a comprehensive data analytics solution for Myntra’s sales performance, transforming raw data into actionable business insights through data cleaning, analysis, and visualization.
The end product is an interactive Excel dashboard designed to support strategic decision-making with dynamic reporting tools and clear visual storytelling.


Project Workflow

Data Acquisition: Collected raw Myntra sales data (Excel format).

Data Cleaning & Preparation:

Removed duplicates and missing values

Standardized columns and corrected inconsistencies

Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA):

Developed pivot tables for product category, brand name, etc.

Applied conditional formatting for pattern identification

Dashboard Design:

Built a visually appealing and interactive dashboard using Excel

Integrated slicers for real-time data filtering and trend exploration

Visualized KPIs such as total revenue, profit, top-selling categories.



Key Insights

Highlighted top-performing product categories and regions.

Identified seasonal and customer segment sales patterns.

Enabled data-driven decision-making through interactive reporting.


Tools & Technologies

Microsoft Excel (Data Cleaning, Pivot Tables,Slicer, Dashboard Design)

Data Analysis Techniques

Visualization


Outcome

A professional-grade Excel-based analytics dashboard that provides a clear and interactive view of Myntra’s sales performance, empowering stakeholders to quickly interpret trends and make informed business decisions.
